  "historyNote": "#6337, eff 9-25-96 (formerly Saf-C 211.07); ss by #8174, INTERIM, eff 9-25-04, EXPIRES: 3-24-05; ss by #8230-B, eff 12-17-04; ss by #10395-B, eff 8-15-13",
